  and `[..., r_y, c_y]`.

  The output tensor is 2-D or higher with shape `[..., r_o, c_o]`, where:

      r_o = c_x if adj_x else r_x
      c_o = r_y if adj_y else c_y

  It is computed as:

      output[..., :, :] = matrix(x[..., :, :]) * matrix(y[..., :, :])

